        Since MLIR provides the following traits `mlir::OpTrait::OneRegion`,
        `mlir::OpTrait::ZeroResults`, `mlir::OpTrait::ZeroSuccessors`,
        `mlir::OpTrait::ZeroOperands`, `mlir::OpTrait::SingleBlock`,
